{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/a60ceab1cda1eb93d5197ca529f0314d.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no second chances. Every familiar has only one life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gone Forever:</strong> If a familiar is defeated in battle, it is permanently lost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run-Ending Stakes:</strong> If your entire team falls, your run is over.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/8c84dd3eef90bd60e067f489df232e89.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a deep, 1v1 tactical battle system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Elemental Forces:</strong> Channel the power of\u00a0Void, Ember, Frost, Mystic, Decay, Aether, Tempest, Stone, Blood, and Shadow \u2014 each type influences your Familiars' battle effectiveness with unique strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploit Weakness:</strong> Mastering type match ups isn't just a bonus\u2014it's essential for survival. No items can be used in battle, so strategy is your only weapon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/bd68e76fdba577ac07980bd9bc8f5796.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture wild familiars and train them to grow their power... but every choice is permanent.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Storage:</strong> You cannot store familiars for later. Your limited party is all you have.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Choices:</strong> Every familiar you add means replacing one you already have. This decision is final.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/1ba1945f9ae4678efdc2585c5c1f2372.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two familiars are ever the same, making every run a new strategic challenge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Stats:</strong> Each familiar has unique natures, growth patterns, and hidden potentials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gambles:</strong> Will you find a diamond in the rough, or a new team member you'll have to protect?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/f3d9c0630c39cadf3cda3483ac7a6ad4.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a procedurally generated gauntlet that is different every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Unforgiving Acts:</strong> Navigate random routes filled with deadly ambushes and fierce rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Powerful Bosses:</strong> Prepare your (hopefully) surviving team to challenge the 5 bosses who stand in your way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/70e9409acf3406e46fb74898fe15210f.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory comes with a choice. After each rival battle, you will claim one of three rewards. Will you take a life-saving restorative, a permanent stat-booster, or another valuable tool to prepare you for the dangers ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/a333be768e3971c47b41a17afac4b104.poster.avif?t=1767322574\" width=960 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/a333be768e3971c47b41a17afac4b104.webm?t=1767322574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154220?t=1767322574","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/70fe7d6a1787d7bcf884a1c7ed67722645e91b7b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767322574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/529343286e88e68f69715522cd2b21365683c5fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767322574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/529343286e88e68f69715522cd2b21365683c5fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767322574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154220/extras/a60ceab1cda1eb93d5197ca529f0314d.avif?t=1767322574\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no second chances. Every familiar has only one life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gone